# Dependencies
node_modules/
# package-lock.json is committed on purpose. It is what pins transitive
# dependencies to the exact versions that were audited; without it every
# install re-resolves and can silently pull a vulnerable version back in.
yarn.lock
pnpm-lock.yaml

# Environment variables
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
# .env.example holds placeholders only and is tracked, so a fresh checkout can
# see which variables are required (JWT_SECRET has a minimum strength the server
# enforces at startup).
!.env.example

# Build outputs
dist/
build/
*.log

# IDE
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Testing
coverage/

# Misc
*.tgz
.npmrc

# Documentation
#
# A blanket `*.md` used to hide every document in the repo, including the
# quickstart, from anyone who cloned it. Docs are tracked now, with these
# exceptions kept out on purpose:

# Written against the Playwright runner branch, which was never merged. It
# documents backend/src/services/playwrightRunner.js and a sandbox firewall
# setup that do not exist here, so tracking it would describe absent code.
docs/RUNNER_EXECUTION_MODEL.md
docs/specs/automation-runner/_source/RUNNER_EXECUTION_MODEL.md

# Superseded: it proposes dependency upgrades as pending work, but the upgrades
# were applied and the lockfile is now tracked.
docs/DEPENDENCY_REMEDIATION.md
docs/specs/dependencies/_source/DEPENDENCY_REMEDIATION.md

# Write-up of a single fixed bug, kept as a personal note rather than reference.
# References a live-looking OpenAI API key prefix — keep out regardless.
docs/BUGFIX_OPENAI.md
docs/specs/ai-authoring/_source/BUGFIX_OPENAI.md

# Operational runbook that names a live database user and an API key prefix.
# This repository is public, so those details stay out of version control.
# The same key prefix also ended up in the two generated spec files below
# when docs/ was restructured into docs/specs/<topic>/ — keep those out too
# until the reference is redacted or confirmed safe to publish.
docs/SECRET_ROTATION_CHECKLIST.md
docs/specs/security-secrets/_source/SECRET_ROTATION_CHECKLIST.md
docs/specs/security-secrets/requirements.md
docs/specs/security-secrets/tasks.md

# Generated by GitNexus, which is no longer set up in this project.
docs/AGENTS.md
docs/CLAUDE.md

# Local AI assistant config and scratch specs. Both were hidden by the old
# blanket `*.md` rule; neither belongs in the repository.
.claude/
.kiro/

.playwright-mcp/